[00:22.291]For just a chance to win your heart
{"只为赢得你芳心的机会"}
[00:27.553]You could set the bar
{"你可以把标准定得"}
[00:30.675]Beyond the stars
{"比星辰更高远"}
[00:33.648]I'll do anything, anything you ask me to
{"我愿意做任何事 任何你要求的事"}
[00:43.691]
[00:43.712]Say you want the moon, watch me learn to fly
{"若你想要月亮 看我学会飞翔"}
